<name>ECU Data Monitor/Active Test</name>
<subpara id="RM000000YF700FX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___000007300000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>When performing inspections related to the large-scale body multiplex communication system [LIN] using SST (TaSCAN) with the IG OFF, repeatedly turn any of the door courtesy light switches ON and OFF (ON/OFF interval within 1.5 seconds).</ptxt>
</atten3>
<step1>
<ptxt>Inspection Using TaSCAN </ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor</ptxt>
<step3>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), use the ECU Data Monitor to judge whether the system is normal and narrow down the malfunctioning area.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
